 funding"},{"text":"Programme requirements"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Application portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong B.Sc. academic record"},{"text":"Solar installation project"},{"text":"PV system design"},{"text":"PVsyst/solar simulation project"},{"text":"Internship with EPC/O&M company"},{"text":"Electrical safety training"},{"text":"Solar monitoring dashboard"},{"text":"Energy-storage project"},{"text":"Academic/professional CV"},{"text":"SOP"},{"text":"Recommendation letters"},{"text":"English-language test if required"}]}]},{"heading":"Going forward","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["Solar Intern","Solar Technician","Senior Solar Technician","Solar Site Supervisor","Solar O&M Engineer/Technical Lead","Solar Project Manager","Renewable Energy Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"Technical route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Solar Technician","Solar Design Assistant","Solar Design Engineer","Senior Solar Design Engineer","Technical Lead","Solar Engineering Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"Entrepreneurial route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Solar Technician","Site Supervisor","EPC Project Coordinator","Solar EPC Entrepreneur"]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong PhD specialisations"},{"type":"p","text":"For students who eventually want research:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Solar Photovoltaics"},{"text":"Perovskite Solar Cells"},{"text":"Advanced PV Materials"},{"text":"Solar Energy Conversion"},{"text":"Energy Storage"},{"text":"Power Electronics"},{"text":"Smart Grids"},{"text":"Renewable Energy Integration"},{"text":"Solar Forecasting"},{"text":"Energy Systems Optimisation"},{"text":"Renewable Energy Economics"},{"text":"Hydrogen and Solar Systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2040–2046"},{"type":"p","text":"A technician who wants long-term career growth should move beyond installation into PV design, commissioning, O&M, battery storage, SCADA and project management. The most valuable technical profile will combine practical electrical skills with digital monitoring, data analytics and renewable-energy system knowledge."}]}]}